Subject: [PATCH] arifi-sync: restore the 2-space JSON indent the R17 register
 edits reformatted

The lane-210 protected-wins and sources.json edits were written back with
json.dump(indent=1), which rewrote every line of both files and buried a 55-line
addition inside a 1018-line diff. Content is unchanged from ce9a2ed60; only the
indent returns to the repository's 2 spaces, so the register history stays
readable. The new arifi-offrig-ci-backend-matrix entry also gets its real commit
sha in place of the PENDING-COMMIT placeholder.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native)
WI: WI-1698
Lane: lane-210
